 Fonts  Effects  Looks  Flow  Settings  Help
 draft mine · no changes · no problems               text preview · t: try live
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Fonts lists the font sets (frits) and the built-in fonts, with any font files
 each is missing. Below the list, the console draws every character of the
 preview in the font it uses now. Press t to try the highlighted font on the
 console, k to keep it, and s to save it in the draft. Press n to make a new
 font set.
     Enter choose  t try live  s save  n new  r remove  i install  q quit

 The Effects tab: a line of filters, then one list in three groups, with a
 preview of the console with the highlighted item applied. The vtlooks come
 first: No filter, then the presets, then the administrator's vtlooks, where
 one that takes a preset's name marks the preset as hidden. Then come the color
 maps and the shaders, each with its active mark and trust mark
   ↑          Moves to the item above.
   ↓          Moves to the item below.
   Home       Goes to the first item.
   End        Goes to the last item.
   PgUp       Moves up by a page.
   PgDn       Moves down by a page.
   Space      On a font, a color map, a shader, a color scheme file or a pointer

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ↑↓ scroll  ←→ Help, About  q quit  . more 1/4
